Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libgtk-made-qt0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GTK 1.2/2/3/4 C API on Qt 6 - shared library
 GTK made Qt implements the GTK C API on Qt, so GTK programs compile
 unmodified as plain C and run as Qt applications, without GTK.
 .
 This package has the shared library, used by programs whose plugins call
 GTK themselves (XMMS, for example). Most programs link the static library
 from gtk-made-qt-dev and do not need it.

Package: gtk-made-qt-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libgtk-made-qt0 (= ${binary:Version}),
         qt6-base-dev,
         libglib2.0-dev,
         libcairo2-dev,
         libpango1.0-dev,
         pkgconf | pkg-config,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: GTK 1.2/2/3/4 C API on Qt 6 - development files
 GTK made Qt implements the GTK C API on Qt, so GTK programs compile
 unmodified as plain C and run as Qt applications, without GTK.
 .
 This package has the headers, the static library, pkg-config files for
 gtk+-2.0, gtk+-3.0, gtk4 and gtk+ (1.2), gtk-config and the
 gtk-made-qt-env wrapper: run a program's build under gtk-made-qt-env to
 build it against GTK made Qt.
